      "message": "We\u0027re only going to have a info.fStagingBuffer when `usesStagingBuffer` is true, so I think this can be simplified to:\n\n    if (info.fStagingBuffer) {\n        info.fStagingBuffer-\u003eunmap();\n        addResourceRef(fStagingBuffer);\n    } else {\n        info.fBuffer-\u003eunmap();\n    }\n    // Always add the buffer\n    addResourceRef(fBuffer);",
